nied him in the Huntsman’s Cloister of the original library wing.",["role"]="Loksey trained the Scarlet Monastery’s tracking hounds."},["id"]="catalog-unit-3974",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"scarlet-monastery"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-loksey",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Houndmaster_Loksey_%28tactics%29",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Houndmaster Loksey"},{["aliases"]={"Interrogator Vishas"},["fieldEvidence"]={["conflict"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-vishas",["receiptSHA256"]="88491bcd0cf9a985ed70356ba24168ebe14568a7ecd70212643929d4fb3e21e7"},["role"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-vishas",["receiptSHA256"]="88491bcd0cf9a985ed70356ba24168ebe14568a7ecd70212643929d4fb3e21e7"}},["fields"]={["conflict"]="His prolonged torture of Vorrel Sengutz included taking the captive’s wedding ring and giving it to Nancy, his own wife.",["role"]="Vishas was the monastery’s human chief interrogator, presiding over the Chamber of Atonement."},["id"]="catalog-unit-3983",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"scarlet-monastery"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-vishas",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Interrogator_Vishas",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Interrogator Vishas"},{["aliases"]={"Vorrel Sengutz"},["fieldEvidence"]={["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-vorrel",["receiptSHA256"]="1d31ce6e8a29c86bca2dd02cdb4ad5668756e529cb718014be6ac487457a09fb"},["relationships"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-vorrel",["receiptSHA256"]="1d31ce6e8a29c86bca2dd02cdb4ad5668756e529cb718014be6ac487457a09fb"}},["fields"]={["history"]="The Forsaken captive lay on a torture table after weeks of abuse by Vishas.",["relationships"]="Monika Sengutz was Vorrel’s wife; the loss of their wedding ring made his suffering a personal grievance as well as a Crusade atrocity."},["id"]="catalog-unit-3981",["kind"]="figure",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"scarlet-monastery"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-vorrel",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Vorrel_Sengutz",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Vorrel Sengutz"},{["aliases"]={"Bloodmage Thalnos"},["fieldEvidence"]={["appearance"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-thalnos",["receiptSHA256"]="ee3e48f8432aa00b6e8175666565787145949653ae826ef97988cbc4555616e7"},["context"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-thalnos",["receiptSHA256"]="ee3e48f8432aa00b6e8175666565787145949653ae826ef97988cbc4555616e7"},["location"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-thalnos",["receiptSHA256"]="ee3e48f8432aa00b6e8175666565787145949653ae826ef97988cbc4555616e7"}},["fields"]={["appearance"]="Thalnos was an undead skeletal mage haunting the monastery’s graveyard.",["context"]="His attacks mixed shadow magic and fiery eruptions, while his proclamations sought vengeance and more souls.",["location"]="His chamber lay below the stairs at the far end of the burial grounds."},["id"]="catalog-unit-4543",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"scarlet-monastery"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-thalnos",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Bloodmage_Thalnos",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Bloodmage Thalnos"},{["aliases"]={"Herod"},["fieldEvidence"]={["appearance"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["rece