s dwarven spirits lingered in the Summoners’ Tomb.",["history"]="The Seven aided sorcerer-thane Thaurissan in the ritual that summoned Ragnaros, dying as their clan fell into the Firelord’s bondage.",["relationships"]="Death had not released them from service to Ragnaros and the reigning Dark Iron emperor."},["id"]="instance-encounter-the-seven",["kind"]="figure",["newSubject"]=true,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"blackrock-depths"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-seven",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/The_Seven",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="The Seven"},{["aliases"]={"Phalanx"},["fieldEvidence"]={["motivation"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-phalanx",["receiptSHA256"]="4849c9094c21f22df7612f00c102df9ab1687fb32891a09fa77711d9997baa3c"},["role"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-phalanx",["receiptSHA256"]="4849c9094c21f22df7612f00c102df9ab1687fb32891a09fa77711d9997baa3c"}},["fields"]={["motivation"]="The construct enforced order with overwhelming force against patrons whose brawls threatened the tavern.",["role"]="Phalanx was the Grim Guzzler’s golem bouncer, employed by Plugger Spazzring."},["id"]="catalog-unit-9502",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"blackrock-depths"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-phalanx",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Phalanx_%28golem%29",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Phalanx"},{["aliases"]={"Ribbly Screwspigot"},["fieldEvidence"]={["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-ribbly",["receiptSHA256"]="19a39e884750e5f16ae33173e80e44d987372b39063b2bc662bf8d61923d4dff"},["location"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-ribbly",["receiptS