ding.",["relationships"]="He and his mate Halycon had bred exceptionally large and ferocious worgs for the orcs."},["id"]="catalog-unit-10268",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-instance-blackrock-spire"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-gizrul",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Gizrul_the_Slavener",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Gizrul the Slavener"},{["aliases"]={"The Beast"},["fieldEvidence"]={["appearance"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-beast-original",["receiptSHA256"]="36b5c1cc8014bf03cbe0e60d1b11e22e4db75edeaf4f0e5b96a32770c4c772ba"},["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-beast-original",["receiptSHA256"]="36b5c1cc8014bf03cbe0e60d1b11e22e4db75edeaf4f0e5b96a32770c4c772ba"},["relationships"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-beast-original",["receiptSHA256"]="36b5c1cc8014bf03cbe0e60d1b11e22e4db75edeaf4f0e5b96a32770c4c772ba"}},["fields"]={["appearance"]="The Beast was a core hound guarding the Furnace in Upper Blackrock Spire.",["history"]="Nefarian’s dragonkin captured and tortured the servant of Ragnaros before retraining it as a guard.",["relationships"]="Pip Quickwit survived within its belly because of his protective lava suit; knowledge of the gnome’s plight did not establish a rescue."},["id"]="catalog-unit-10430",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-instance-blackrock-spire"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-beast-original",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/The_Beast",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="The Beast"},{["aliases"]={"Lord Valthalak"},["fieldEvidence"]={["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"