ed himself with healing wards, mind-controlling totems and multiplying shades. His enchantments made the spirits and totems more dangerous than his weapon alone."},["id"]="catalog-unit-11380",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"zul-gurub"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-jindo-original",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Jin%27do_the_Hexxer",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Jin'do the Hexxer"},{["aliases"]={"Jed Runewatcher"},["fieldEvidence"]={["location"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-jed-original",["receiptSHA256"]="3a31764151d1e4190499ef527c573b9eb37490df27e5dab9b6a7dbe41f3d26e2"},["role"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-jed-original",["receiptSHA256"]="3a31764151d1e4190499ef527c573b9eb37490df27e5dab9b6a7dbe41f3d26e2"}},["fields"]={["location"]="He could wander near Goraluk Anvilcrack’s chamber or the Furnace.",["role"]="Jed was an orc of the Blackhand Legion who appeared only occasionally in Upper Blackrock Spire."},["id"]="catalog-unit-10509",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-instance-blackrock-spire"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-jed-original",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Jed_Runewatcher",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Jed Runewatcher"},{["aliases"]={"Skul"},["fieldEvidence"]={["appearance"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-skul",["receiptSHA256"]="effaa621f54be9198c8558461a63363662c27f1ae4da912088468565439fed43"},["context"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-skul",["receiptSHA256"]="effaa621f54be9198c8558461a63363662c27f1ae4da912088468565439fed43"},["location"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCE