gether: damage to one hurt the other, while proximity let them heal each other. Repeated teleportation exchanged their positions.",["role"]="The brothers Vek’lor and Vek’nilash ruled the qiraji from the sanctuary of their temple."},["id"]="instance-encounter-twin-emperors",["kind"]="figure",["newSubject"]=true,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-instance-temple-of-ahnqiraj"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-twin-emperors",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Twin_Emps",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Twin Emperors"},{["aliases"]={"Emperor Vek'lor"},["fieldEvidence"]={["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-veklor",["receiptSHA256"]="112c3481a97d938d575fd0631d22bf6d6a0362f9f193ee9df546aac0701d9e86"},["role"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-veklor",["receiptSHA256"]="112c3481a97d938d575fd0631d22bf6d6a0362f9f193ee9df546aac0701d9e86"}},["fields"]={["history"]="The emperors prepared powerful constructs for their armies, including Moam, whose stone shell Vek’lor strengthened with magic.",["role"]="Vek’lor was the spellcasting twin, brother and co-ruler of Vek’nilash."},["id"]="catalog-unit-15276",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-instance-temple-of-ahnqiraj"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-veklor",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Emperor_Vek%27lor",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Emperor Vek'lor"},{["aliases"]={"Emperor Vek'nilash"},["fieldEvidence"]={["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-veknilash",["receiptSHA256"]="ab7afb43e4d724ab6b65a44de91e3d6c40cfb95a36ef8ccd19de8c18b43b6a2b"},["relationships"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-veknilash",["rec