al’s blighted woods."},["id"]="catalog-location-area-168",["kind"]="place",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-place-tirisfal-glades"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-tirisfal-original",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Tirisfal_Glades_%28Forever%29",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="The North Coast"},{["aliases"]={"The Bulwark"},["fieldEvidence"]={["relationships"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-tirisfal-original",["receiptSHA256"]="26ddf068035559e8842f9492eaf29038025be26adeeb738102d492e91e63046c"}},["fields"]={["relationships"]="Forsaken and Argent Dawn forces held the frontier post with limited supplies for travelers entering the Plaguelands."},["id"]="catalog-location-area-152",["kind"]="place",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-place-tirisfal-glades"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-tirisfal-original",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Tirisfal_Glades_%28Forever%29",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="The Bulwark"},{["aliases"]={"Agamand Mills"},["fieldEvidence"]={["conflict"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-agamand-mills",["receiptSHA256"]="bce2510fa7ed91ee48b20dced20216f3ec3aa15ad383bd9b6ed07c20334ff972"},["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-agamand-mills",["receiptSHA256"]="bce2510fa7ed91ee48b20dced20216f3ec3aa15ad383bd9b6ed07c20334ff972"}},["fields"]={["conflict"]="Devlin’s betrayal weakened the defense; the fallen family and its mills became a Scourge foothold against the Forsaken.",["history"]="The wealthy Agamands fortified their mills against the Scourge, persuading their workers to remain beside them."},["id"]="catalog-location-area-157",["kind"]="place",["newSubject"]=f