ients around Brewnall, part of his family’s efforts to perfect dwarven ale."},["id"]="catalog-unit-1374",["kind"]="figure",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"dun-morogh"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-brewnall",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Brewnall_Village",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Rejold Barleybrew"},{["aliases"]={"Devlin Agamand"},["fieldEvidence"]={["appearance"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-devlin-original",["receiptSHA256"]="d4b391d26c9ea8ee79b2dee1519680acf23670d9adc696bb0495c5dc38092437"},["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-devlin-original",["receiptSHA256"]="d4b391d26c9ea8ee79b2dee1519680acf23670d9adc696bb0495c5dc38092437"}},["fields"]={["appearance"]="The Agamands’ younger son wandered the ruined mills as a skeletal mage.",["history"]="Weak and sharp-tongued in life, he betrayed the family to the Scourge."},["id"]="catalog-unit-1657",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-place-tirisfal-glades"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-devlin-original",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Devlin_Agamand",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Devlin Agamand"},{["aliases"]={"Thurman Agamand"},["fieldEvidence"]={["appearance"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-thurman-original",["receiptSHA256"]="59732c09eec9e0a8736eb90f12ef79b15e83998871fad332f08a373651392b84"},["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-thurman-original",["receiptSHA256"]="59732c09eec9e0a8736eb90f12ef79b15e83998871fad332f08a373651392b84"},["relationships"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-thurman-original",["receiptSHA256"]="59