 Baron was an abomination loose in the ruined capital.",["location"]="The creature occupied King’s Alley."},["id"]="catalog-unit-250660",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="FOREVER_BETA_REFERENCE_NOT_RELEASE_CERTIFIED_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-instance-ruins-of-lordaeron"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-forever-baron",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/The_Baron",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="The Baron"},{["aliases"]={"The Baron"},["fieldEvidence"]={["conflict"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-forever-garithos",["receiptSHA256"]="ea6023974a08a8f1ff912561be50f19d5f86d648dddf59d93374f0117dbb974b"},["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-forever-garithos",["receiptSHA256"]="ea6023974a08a8f1ff912561be50f19d5f86d648dddf59d93374f0117dbb974b"}},["fields"]={["conflict"]="His old captain Truman still awaited his return without recognizing what had become of their commander.",["history"]="The abomination was Othmar Garithos, repeatedly reassembled after his death and no longer under reliable control."},["id"]="catalog-unit-250660",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="FOREVER_BETA_REFERENCE_NOT_RELEASE_CERTIFIED_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-instance-ruins-of-lordaeron"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-forever-garithos",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Othmar_Garithos",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="The Baron"},{["aliases"]={"Captain Truman"},["fieldEvidence"]={["context"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-forever-truman",["receiptSHA256"]="92d06a41cc9f0e4f9e727673a983db488f36a5f4af1a65b90e0f1f9b6e2c4b7c"},["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-forever-truman",["receiptSHA256"]="92d06a41cc9f0e4f9e727673a983db488f36a5f4af1a65b90e0f1f9b6e2c4b7c"},["motivation"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_I