, where a large green drake patrolled the region.",["location"]="The Sorrowmurk lay east of the Pool of Tears and the Sunken Temple in the Swamp of Sorrows."},["id"]="catalog-location-area-1778",["kind"]="place",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-place-swamp-of-sorrows"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-sorrowmurk-original",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Sorrowmurk",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Sorrowmurk"},{["aliases"]={"Pool of Tears"},["fieldEvidence"]={["appearance"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-pool-of-tears-location",["receiptSHA256"]="d1861715e6acd5f85d3422793632eba885af3fc3ab3ce2db08ad1a2b6a1d0611"}},["fields"]={["appearance"]="The Pool of Tears spread as a large body of water across the eastern Swamp of Sorrows."},["id"]="catalog-location-area-74",["kind"]="place",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-place-swamp-of-sorrows"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-pool-of-tears-location",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Pool_of_Tears",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Pool of Tears"},{["aliases"]={"Hewa's Armory"},["fieldEvidence"]={["relationships"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-shop-hewa",["receiptSHA256"]="6800b3b860767e3e8b1106d2315bdc569a7e9598191c54ae05a20c2b19ae5690"},["role"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-shop-hewa",["receiptSHA256"]="6800b3b860767e3e8b1106d2315bdc569a7e9598191c54ae05a20c2b19ae5690"}},["fields"]={["relationships"]="Hewa sold cloth armor here, alongside Elki’s mail and Ahanu’s leather goods.",["role"]="An armor shop on Thunder Bluff’s lower rise, Hewa’s Armory supplied several kinds of protective clothing."},["id"]="world-place-hewa-s-armory",["kind"]