d be found at the shop.",["role"]="Gallina Winery was the Gallina family’s wine shop along Stormwind’s canals."},["id"]="world-place-gallina-winery",["kind"]="place",["newSubject"]=true,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"stormwind"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-shop-gallina",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Gallina_Winery",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Gallina Winery"},{["aliases"]={"Baron Silverlaine"},["fieldEvidence"]={["appearance"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-silverlaine-dining",["receiptSHA256"]="4724b5676010822ddff096d45c214a4012f3a32e37e74c8dbc50e970cf236c9f"},["context"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-silverlaine-dining",["receiptSHA256"]="4724b5676010822ddff096d45c214a4012f3a32e37e74c8dbc50e970cf236c9f"},["location"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-silverlaine-dining",["receiptSHA256"]="4724b5676010822ddff096d45c214a4012f3a32e37e74c8dbc50e970cf236c9f"}},["fields"]={["appearance"]="The former baron remained as a ghost within Shadowfang Keep.",["context"]="His original Veil of Shadow hindered the healing of those who confronted him.",["location"]="Silverlaine haunted the dining room with servants from his former household."},["id"]="catalog-unit-3887",["kind"]="creature",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"shadowfang-keep"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-silverlaine-dining",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Baron_Silverlaine_%28Classic%29",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Baron Silverlaine"},{["aliases"]={"Gilnid"},["fieldEvidence"]={["appearance"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-gilnid-cannons",["receiptSHA256"]="eb493449b86651c57797a79fffb0ce30e3184a7e0c24432d6d3