nnar, making it one of the blue flight’s notable refuges outside Northrend."},["id"]="catalog-location-area-1234",["kind"]="place",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-place-azshara"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-place-lake-mennar",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Lake_Mennar",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Lake Mennar"},{["aliases"]={"Jagged Reef"},["fieldEvidence"]={["appearance"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-place-jagged-reef",["receiptSHA256"]="4899b39001ac0bb7bc5995fb9ba613d223ddd445afad7097dc4a4798715c8037"},["context"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-place-jagged-reef",["receiptSHA256"]="4899b39001ac0bb7bc5995fb9ba613d223ddd445afad7097dc4a4798715c8037"},["relationships"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-place-jagged-reef",["receiptSHA256"]="4899b39001ac0bb7bc5995fb9ba613d223ddd445afad7097dc4a4798715c8037"}},["fields"]={["appearance"]="Azshara’s northern coast alternated between sandy beaches, protruding stone and small sea inlets.",["context"]="Submerged rocks and treacherous shallows made the shoreline hazardous to traverse.",["relationships"]="Murlocs, hydras and makrura inhabited the beaches and shallows."},["id"]="catalog-location-area-1230",["kind"]="place",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-place-azshara"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-place-jagged-reef",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Jagged_Reef",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Jagged Reef"},{["aliases"]={"Gunther's Retreat"},["fieldEvidence"]={["context"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-gunther-retreat-history",["receiptSHA256"]="f9e54a3c3ec4e72c966ada7ca6f4d07bc6f0e5a56c42d4b0f9af4c39f70e0986"},["role"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-gunther-retreat-history",["receiptSHA256"]="f9e54a3c3ec4e72c966ada7ca6f4d07bc6f0e5a56c42d4b0f9af4c39f70e0986"}},["fields"]={["context"]="His zombie minions attacked approaching strangers, protecting the free-willed lich’s seclusion.",["role"]="Gunther Arcanus isolated himself at the retreat, believing other undead remained slaves of the Scourge."},["id"]="catalog-location-area-163",["kind"]="place",["newSubject"]=false,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-place-tirisfal-glades"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-gunther-retreat-history",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Gunther_Arcanus",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Gunther's Retreat"},{["aliases"]={"Legash Encampment"},["fieldEvidence"]={["location"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-place-legash-encampment",["receiptSHA256"]="367e6e124428aefb2433bfa1f14de800550337df0595a9586c96b333f39d511a"},["role"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="wiki-place-legash-encampment",["receiptSHA256"]="367e6e124428aefb2433bfa1f14de800550337df0595a9586c96b333f39d511a"}},["fields"]={["location"]="The Legash Encampment stood in northern Azshara, east of Ursolan and north of the Thalassian Base Camp.",["role"]="Legashi satyrs occupied the camp."},["id"]="world-place-legash-encampment",["kind"]="place",["newSubject"]=true,["qualification"]="CLASSIC_HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_NOT_CURRENT_FOREVER_MECHANICS_OR_PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE",["related"]={"atlas-place-azshara"},["sourceKey"]="wiki-place-legash-encampment",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Legash_Encampment",["sourceVersion"]="instance-boss-histories-2026-10-26-r3",["title"]="Legash Encampment"},{["aliases"]={"Mistvale Valley"},["fieldEvidence"]={["location"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_SECONDARY_EXCERPT",["receip